    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/85005c630497458a73e7bbb438dd9c6d.poster.avif?t=1754882252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/85005c630497458a73e7bbb438dd9c6d.webm?t=1754882252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/85005c630497458a73e7bbb438dd9c6d.mp4?t=1754882252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/454217423eef4b5df1bbf2fd18714715.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><strong>Metaball is a free-to-play, crossplay-enabled online multiplayer sports game that combines fast-paced movements, thrilling PvP matches, and advanced team play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You play as a Rider, trying to bring fame and wealth to his name by winning merciless Metaball League games with his teammates and collecting Metanium and MVP points.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/1a4987f558a2a40a665c7dd9e8dd00a6.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/7b52451581c9b84c07e5ad123016c108.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hop on your hoverboard, grab the ball with your chain, and use its swinging power to perform diverse actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dunk, shoot, block, and steal the ball while using the nitro to boost your speed or perform double or triple jumps!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your Perk Points in different Perk Trees to customize your play style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/c4bb51002163c7fe0ac5dfd01a139eb5.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/ded1854d53bdfbb92e2296382fc30a6b.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><strong>Compete against other riders in various PvP game modes, including 2v2 and 3v3 Quick Matches, or hone your skills in Academy, Champion Road, Free Play, or Custom Match modes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/f0b02d3293de4a07bf1842e331d1598d.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/cb865221458a43020bec45d697299587.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After each match, you will receive MVP points depending on the result. So make sure to win and to be the best Rider to receive a bonus!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The more you have MVP points, the more you will unlock rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/9cf7a811f4f90f75fefc400e8c437cac.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/2917179077d8832b7a42a95c440db1a6.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><strong>With your hard-earned Metanium and MVP points, progress in the Metapass, and try to collect your favorite equipment and items to use in the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Items shown may require separate purchases from the in-game store and are subject to availability. Contains in-game purchases.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/85005c630497458a73e7bbb438dd9c6d.poster.avif?t=1754882252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/85005c630497458a73e7bbb438dd9c6d.webm?t=1754882252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/85005c630497458a73e7bbb438dd9c6d.mp4?t=1754882252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/454217423eef4b5df1bbf2fd18714715.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><strong>Metaball is a free-to-play, crossplay-enabled online multiplayer sports game that combines fast-paced movements, thrilling PvP matches, and advanced team play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You play as a Rider, trying to bring fame and wealth to his name by winning merciless Metaball League games with his teammates and collecting Metanium and MVP points.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/1a4987f558a2a40a665c7dd9e8dd00a6.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/7b52451581c9b84c07e5ad123016c108.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hop on your hoverboard, grab the ball with your chain, and use its swinging power to perform diverse actions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dunk, shoot, block, and steal the ball while using the nitro to boost your speed or perform double or triple jumps!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use your Perk Points in different Perk Trees to customize your play style!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/c4bb51002163c7fe0ac5dfd01a139eb5.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/ded1854d53bdfbb92e2296382fc30a6b.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><strong>Compete against other riders in various PvP game modes, including 2v2 and 3v3 Quick Matches, or hone your skills in Academy, Champion Road, Free Play, or Custom Match modes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/f0b02d3293de4a07bf1842e331d1598d.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/cb865221458a43020bec45d697299587.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After each match, you will receive MVP points depending on the result. So make sure to win and to be the best Rider to receive a bonus!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The more you have MVP points, the more you will unlock rewards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/9cf7a811f4f90f75fefc400e8c437cac.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215910/extras/2917179077d8832b7a42a95c440db1a6.avif?t=1754882252\" /></div><strong>With your hard-earned Metanium and MVP points, progress in the Metapass, and try to collect your favorite equipment and items to use in the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Items shown may require separate purchases from the in-game store and are subject to availability. Contains in-game purchases.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the thrill of Hoverboard Basketball! Team up or challenge players worldwide in fast-paced crossplay PvP matches. Master the ball, dribble, and outwit your opponents to score impressive goals\u2014 with no aim assist. Only skill and creativity matter. Grab your Hoverboard and dominate now!",
